{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"75862533bdfefd08d6e5c0bac9798c3ee52a2cae53de0c68616d9fdce41d8c7d","ja":"VRゲームの世界へ！","zh":"前往VR游戏的世界！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"fe51518fb83908732c30f88fb9175b194522ca47e8616509e4adbb3241f97432","ja":"今日のお仕事は、VRゲームのPR！\nそのプレイ動画を撮影することになっていて……","zh":"今天的工作是宣传VR游戏！\n还要拍摄游戏的试玩视频……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a97e276bb7fa2be9b839829de94206e238cb579e340ac7fc24dccb6919bb12be","ja":"んっふっふ～。お仕事でゲームができちゃうなんて、\nめーっちゃ、ラッキーだね♪","zh":"嗯哼哼～。工作的时候居然还能玩游戏，\n真是超～级走运呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"208dfa7cdc303e1479bfe935127540ab175adae143ca36ad84e219e0a5980459","ja":"でも、ホラー系のゲームなんだよね？\n新作のFPSを先行プレイできるのは嬉しいけど……。","zh":"可是，那是恐怖类的游戏吧？\n虽然能抢先试玩FPS新作是很开心啦……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b75eb7633f00aaca64eac89a34def609bf08e2af0a463f2b9531f8c4e95b710f","ja":"大丈夫！　杏奈、ホラー系も平気だから！\nビビッと、お任せだよ～！","zh":"没问题！杏奈看恐怖题材也完全不怕的！\n闪亮登场，包在我身上吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"568df5aa676fd810ed8a0b3a73bbadb11a49a203044ed3ad55a1b244d8fd569c","ja":"「撮影準備できました！\nそれでは、ゲームを始めてください！」","zh":"「拍摄准备完毕！\n那么，请开始游戏！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"828a7778e5b01bf585ac267c755cd10157d9b4863f0c65acd0568651b968309a","ja":"あ、ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃあ、始めますね……。","zh":"啊、谢谢您。\n那么，这就开始了哦……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"ba7668533e9e1bf35aded4d61a1f0dd53d32de242be8c88d5a2bcc290564cb50","ja":"こ、校舎の再現率、すごいね。\n本当に、夜中の学校に来たみたい……。","zh":"学、学校的还原度好高啊。\n真的像是在半夜来到了学校一样……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"67c8ac66fa4e7163884375d7f1d27b987d008e45a5f4c73eff40ecc346863a70","ja":"レーザー銃のデザインも細かくて、カッコいいよ！\nあっ、ゾンビが出てきた！　えいっ！","zh":"激光枪的设计也很精细，好帅气啊！\n啊，僵尸跑出来了！嘿！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"3c8c7049eb3542f39994c35486b3fd03effe8f6162ae699d7a2d2bbfb38e5586","ja":"バシュッ！\n……グワーーーッ！！","zh":"唰——！\n……哇啊啊啊——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"9ea4b8a99ba7c747542793ac1ecca4aeb349f0ff20af6aa6bb1b4703deb98248","ja":"ナイスショット！　わ、私も頑張らなきゃ……。\nキャーッ！　こっちからも来た～！","zh":"好球！我、我也得加油才行……。\n呀——！这边也有球飞过来了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"5509af4f323536db7ea9e6e54472b61b4721677d7b54a12dcae17aa6ff9ca957","ja":"私もあんまり、ホラーは得意じゃないんだけど……。\nわ、来た！　えいっ！　えいっ！　ええ～いっ！","zh":"我也不是很擅长应付恐怖的东西就是了……\n哇，来了！看招！看招！看——招！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"3e528ef99829548f41a62f5692c4f983023cd77365205f01e0bcbd50160b78ae","ja":"バシュッ！　バシュッ！　バシュッ！\n……グワーッ！！","zh":"嗖！　嗖！　嗖！\n……哇啊——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8cfda34d2c0e1e62397740d63ae5404d39fcb81b6e73c17d0167ebf96477c80d","ja":"みらいっち、飛ばすね～！\n亜美も負けてられないぜ！　うりゃうりゃ～！","zh":"未来亲，冲得很猛嘛～！\n亚美也不能认输！看招看招～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"23d0a68791ea7e39abe990df521e5c2d4a0acade0c957ef1c0b60998012b7cfe","ja":"バシュッ！　バシュッ！\n……グワーッ！！　グワーッ！！","zh":"咻！　咻！\n……哇啊——！！　哇啊——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"f1278368769f36aede6a9ff0674ede68755264534fd920c81de7a9cd073863ec","ja":"はあ、はあ、はあ……。\nあ、もしかして、もう倒しちゃったのかな？","zh":"哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……\n啊，难道说，已经打倒了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"cb61fa31dde8301a94b6c8544e0ea8a94b35d53b74d9f2b7ff00d4990ce39c0a","ja":"まだまだだよ、みらいっち！\nほら、後ろ！","zh":"还差得远呢，未来っち！\n看，后面！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1630.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"bf2394b8c51c79d4cd1a13cf6210127a1444966bdca175d8cfcf6378265a27bf","ja":"わわわっ！　こ、こんなに！？\nこ、こないで～っ！","zh":"哇哇哇！怎、怎么这么多！？\n别、别过来啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
